{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/29593","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:34.877405+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Unfortunately I think this is working as expected. The semantics of `ravel_pytree` are to convert inputs to a common type, and when X64 is disabled there is no floating point type available with enough precision to handle the full `uint32` range.\n\nYou could work around this by enabling 64-bit types in which case the raveled array will use `float64` (see https://docs.jax.dev/en/latest/default_dtypes.html):\n```python\nimport jax\njax.config.update('jax_enable_x64', True)\n\nfrom jax import numpy as jnp, flatten_util, lax\npt = {'foo': jnp.array([2**31 + 1], dtype=jnp.uint32), 'bar': jnp.array([2.])}\n\nflat, unflatten = flatten_util.ravel_pytree(pt)\n\nunflatten(flat)['foo'][0].astype(jnp.uint32)  # prints 2**31 + 1\n```\nBut of course that would fail with large `uint64` values for the same reason.\n\nOverall, if your code is sensitive to these kinds of precision issues, it's probably best to avoid routines like `ravel_pytree` that coerce all data to a common type.","created_at":"2025-06-19T23:45:20Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/29593#issuecomment-2989416091","id":2989416091,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/29593","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6yLt6b","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2989416091/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-06-19T23:45:48Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2989416091","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"NONE","body":"Sir,\n\nThank you for confirmation. That's fine, I can use `lax::bitcast_convert_type`.","created_at":"2025-06-20T09:31:18Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/29593#issuecomment-2990481097","id":2990481097,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/29593","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6yPx7J","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2990481097/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-06-20T09:31:18Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2990481097","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68515071?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bondquant","id":68515071,"login":"bondquant","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NTE1MDcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nDear Sirs,\n\n  Hi there. `ravel_pytree` seems to truncate integers larger than `2**31` if the pytree has mixed integer and floating-point types. I have found a workaround with `lax::bitcast_convert_type` to `f32`, see below. This affects for example storing PRNG keys in flattened pytrees (I bumped into this problem while trying to freeze randomness between unrolling a trajectory and learning from a replay buffer, which is a mixed-type flattened pytree).\n\n```\nimport jax\nfrom jax import numpy as jnp, flatten_util, lax\npt = {'foo': jnp.array([2**31 + 1], dtype=jnp.uint32), 'bar': jnp.array([2.])}\n\nflat, unflatten = flatten_util.ravel_pytree(pt)\n\nunflatten(flat)['foo'][0].astype(jnp.uint32)  # prints 2**31\n```\n\nWorkaround by casting with `lax::bitcast_convert_type` to `float32`:\n```\npt2 = {'foo': lax.bitcast_convert_type(jnp.array([2**31 + 1], dtype=jnp.uint32), jnp.float32), 'bar': jnp.array([2.])}\nflat2, unflatten2 = flatten_util.ravel_pytree(pt2)\nlax.bitcast_convert_type(unflatten2(flat2)['foo'][0], jnp.uint32)  # prints 2**31+1\n```\n\nIt also works if I change the type of `bar` to an integer (but this is less practical because my real pytree has mostly floating-point numbers and a small number of uint32s rather than the other way round):\n```\npt = {'foo': jnp.array([2**31 + 1], dtype=jnp.uint32), 'bar': jnp.array([2])}\nflat, unflatten = flatten_util.ravel_pytree(pt)\nunflatten(flat)['foo'][0].astype(jnp.uint32)  # prints 2**31+1\n```\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\njax:    0.5.2\njaxlib: 0.5.1\nnumpy:  2.0.2\npython: 3.11.13 (main, Jun  4 2025, 08:57:29) [GCC 11.4.0]\ndevice info: cpu-1, 1 local devices\"\nprocess_count: 1\nplatform: uname_result(system='Linux', node='10e0d5b5af73', release='6.1.123+', version='#1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sun Mar 30 16:01:29 UTC 2025', machine='x86_64')\n```","closed_at":"2025-06-20T09:31:18Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68515071?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bondquant","id":68515071,"login":"bondquant","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NTE1MDcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bondquant","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":2,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/29593/comments","created_at":"2025-06-19T19:44:25Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/29593/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/29593","id":3161204844,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/29593/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc68bChs","number":29593,"performed_v